ial—he is my husband.","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":0.984,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-56-2"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3054003","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"61477eeb112e09a5d0036c15d6cd48c49ac0581c2af22cb70b94a6aa236bf9c0","compact":"3914e4259d20fe1ec6148789ef6f457e854855e04a9553b8ae0344b45bb7a484","nasal":"3914e4259d20fe1ec6148789ef6f457e854855e04a9553b8ae0344b45bb7a484"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-54-4","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":54,"verse":4,"english":"Born in the race of the Ikşvākus, the has the shoulders of a lion and is possessed of exceeding effulgence-the same that along with his brother, Laksmana, shall take your life. If you had wronged me forcibly in his presence, you would have slain in battle in Janasthāna even as Khara.","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":0.877,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-56-3"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3054004","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"15977b46f71a22a1c16e0ac7cc9304ab56c3616e6f5827e87bf681df825a45e3","compact":"a281a10455f4c259fac33f221083612a5b4bfc36d717dce5203f1712c833a446","nasal":"880b703f45639c9a72b159e6acd0b5f10637d34cad8466d3e237a8c016a7c114"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-54-5","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":54,"verse":5,"english":"Born in the race of the Ikşvākus, the has the shoulders of a lion and is possessed of exceeding effulgence-the same that along with his brother, Laksmana, shall take your life. If you had wronged me forcibly in his presence, you would have slain in battle in Janasthāna even as Khara.","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":0.821,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-56-3"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3054005","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"e